WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.002
- This is where we will live.

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:04.630
- Only in America.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:11.470
- Only in America do you add tax
after you see the ticket price.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:16.683
- Only in America can such a
perfect game exist. Baseball.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.435
- Hamburgers. Cheeseburgers.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:21.355
Bacon chili cheeseburgers.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.190
Everything on top of everything.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.150
Only in America.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:28.487
(jazz music plays)

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:30.822
(desk bell rings)

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:33.825
- Welcome to the Economy Value Inn.
How may I help you?

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.285
(jazz music plays)

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.168
- I am going to America soon.

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:44.586
I'm gonna be a Hollywood star.

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:54.888
- I am looking for instinct.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.015
(grunts)

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.308
- Damn.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.773
- (both) We're trying.

00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:06.483
(pop music plays)

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.068
- This is where we will live.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:09.486
- You see the rock, right?

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.364
- You see a rock.
I see an opportunity.

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:15.993
♪ I slipped on the pebbles
on the way to the gate ♪

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.619
- We'll only be gone a short time.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.955
♪ You were up... ♪

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.874
- Everyone here is sad.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.792
- That's everywhere, isn't it?

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:28.463
I mean, at least here they give
you all-you-can-eat shrimp.

00:01:28.547 --> 00:01:30.507
(pop music plays)

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:38.307
♪ Never live in fear again ♪

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:41.268
- This is life.
We don't always get another shot.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.729
(cheering)

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:46.648
- You always thinking
of going to moon

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:48.025
when we haven't left the ground.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:53.697
♪ Never live in fear again ♪

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.326
♪ No, never again ♪

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:06.668
- You'll see.
I'm going to take you to the moon.

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:09.129
(pop music plays)

